(TriGuard Demo - Employee Leave Policy 2026) '
(Section 1: Annual Leave Entitlement) '
(All full-time employees are granted 25 days of paid annual leave per calendar year.) '
(Leave requests must be submitted at least two weeks in advance through the HR portal.) '
(Section 2: Sick Leave and Medical Absence) '
(Employees receive 10 paid sick days annually with certified medical documentation.) '
(Section 3: Parental and Family Care Leave) '
(Eligible primary caregivers receive 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave.) '
(Section 4: Classification and Scope) '
(This document is classified as INTERNAL corporate policy applicable across all departments.) '
